Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:04.50,English,C05-06-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}The base game offers “Split in half,” “Split off new Army,” “Reorganize,” and “Merge armies.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.13,0:00:11.93,Chinese,C05-06-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}平分把现有军队分成规模大致相等的两支，整编调整两支军队中的编制。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.13,0:00:11.93,English,C05-06-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1008)}Splitting in half makes two roughly equal armies.\NReorganizing changes how regiments are assigned between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.53,0:00:17.03,Chinese,C05-06-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}会合只是走到同地，点合并之后才真正成为一支。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.53,0:00:17.03,English,C05-06-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}Reuniting means reaching the same location; clicking Merge makes them one army.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.63,0:00:21.56,Chinese,C05-06-S04,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}名称、下令与实际组织变化分别核对。
